WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Services depend on ICT Systems, networks, software and devices working together.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Follow recorded relationships to identify components that may support a service.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A component issue may have wider implications. Recorded links help frame the investigation.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Confirm dependencies and operational context with owners before drawing conclusions about service impact.
